Guide pictures: how they were taken
===================================
Both user guides' pictures were taken on the ROL test bed (RISC OS 5.31-5,
1920x1080, 16M colours) with these scripts. Run start-new.sh, then
new1.sh to new7.sh in order; start-new2.sh then new8.sh; start-print.sh
then new9.sh; start-lib.sh then new10.sh (which also leaves DogsLib in
IXFS:$.RISCOS), start-lib.sh again then new11.sh. The icon bar menu
(iconbar-menu) was taken by hand: Menu on the icon, cropped 1750,825 to
1920,1080. Glow (0.0.29): glow-panel from the Viewer on Labradors (Dogs_and_garden,
Adjustments tab scrolled to the end, Amount 40, Warmth 25); glow.png and
the styles sheet are host renders (~/look, ~/styles,
4 columns); styles-preview retaken on Leading_out with the pointer on
Sunlit Garden. The LumenRaw guide: guide's start.sh, then lumenraw-shots.sh.

0.0.37: the menu pictures (photo-menu, presets-menu, selection-menu,
label-menu, versions-menu, plugins-menu, add-plugin) and styles-preview
were retaken by hand for the grouped menus, with Eventing and Schooling
imported: Leading_out in the Viewer, Photo > Adjust > Presets > Styles,
the pointer on Sunlit Garden.

0.0.38: layers (layers, layers-panel, layers-list, panel-folded) taken by
hand on Terrier (Dogs_and_garden) with the Layers tool: two radial
layers drawn round the terrier, the second inverted at -0.75 EV; the
window cropped to 1800 x 952 and scaled to 1100 wide; the panel pictures
are 350 x 880 crops of the Adjustments tab.

0.0.38: Lens Correction, by hand, with LumenLens and LumenRaw 1.3 in
the test bed: lens-panel (the guide's, and the LumenLens guide's panel)
from Polo after Auto, a 350 x 190 crop of the Adjustments tab;
lens-camera from Show_jumping (Eventing; its EXIF names no camera)
with the Camera menu open, the menu cropped; the LumenLens guide's
lens-menu and all-lenses from _DSC2370 (Raw) after Auto, Lens, All
lenses > Nikon > From 70 to 85 mm; plugins-menu from the icon bar
menu's Plug-ins. lens-vignetting (and the LumenLens cover) is a host
render of Polo at 1800 pixels, before and with its Auto profile, the
halves side by side, scaled to 900 wide.

The photos are Andrew Youll's own (copyright Andrew Youll, used with his
permission), in IXFS:$.RISCOS.Photos: Eventing, Schooling, Portraits,
Dogs_and_garden, Polo and Jousting (JPEGs) and Raw (three Nikon D700
NEFs). They are not kept in the repository.

The styles sheet is made on the host: render.c and sheet.py in
~/styles (Lumen's develop on a small copy of Upright).

